<title>USA: Delta Financial proforma shr profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Delta Financial proforma shr profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>WOODBURY, N.Y. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>DELTA FINANCIAL CORP</p>
<p>				  PRO FORMA</p>
<p>			   CONSOLIDATED INCOME STATEMENT</p>
<p>		 (DOLLARS IN THOUSANDS, EXCEPT PER SHARE DATA)</p>
<p>				 (UNAUDITED)</p>
<p>				THREE MONTHS ENDED  NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>						 SEPT. 30,    SEPT. 30,</p>
<p>					  1996    1995     1996    1995</p>
<p>REVENUES:</p>
<p>  NET GAIN ON SALE OF LOANS  $13,702     $49  $31,502  $5,384</p>
<p>  INTEREST INCOME		  4,094   3,653   11,955   9,015</p>
<p>  SERVICE FEES		     1,446     787    3,771   2,026</p>
<p>  OTHER				1,475     163    3,820   2,020</p>
<p>    TOTAL REVENUE		 20,717   4,652   51,048  18,445</p>
<p>EXPENSES:</p>
<p>  PAYROLL &amp; RELATED COSTS	4,604     743   11,289   5,101</p>
<p>  INTEREST EXPENSE		 2,607   2,120    8,529   5,590</p>
<p>GENERAL &amp; ADMINISTRATIVE COSTS</p>
<p>					 3,474   2,210    9,105   6,357</p>
<p>    TOTAL EXPENSES		10,685   5,073   28,923  17,048</p>
<p>EARNINGS BEFORE EXTRAORDINARY</p>
<p>  ITEM				10,032   (421)   22,125   1,397</p>
